### 1. 注册（用户已存在会失败，可跳过）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "myq",
  "password": "123456",
  "email": "myq@example.com"
}

### 2. 登录（先点这个，会自动把 token 存起来）
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "myq",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### 3. 查看我的简历（必须先成功执行上面的登录）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resumes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 上传简历（把下面路径换成你自己的 PDF）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resumes/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="resume.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\Users\qqjer\Desktop\简历\简历 (1).pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

### 5. 解析简历（把 id 改成真实 resumeId）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resumes/3/parse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. AI 分析简历（Java 调用 Python，需先 parse）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resumes/3/ai-analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 查询最新 AI 分析结果
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resumes/3/ai-analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 删除简历（把 id 改成真实 resumeId）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resumes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. AI 岗位匹配
POST http://localhost:8080/api/job-matches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resumeId": 3,
  "jobName": "Java开发工程师",
  "companyName": "XX科技有限公司",
  "jobDescription": "负责Java后端系统开发；熟悉Java、Spring Boot、MySQL、Redis；了解Spring Cloud；有良好的代码规范；有项目开发经验。优先考虑有微服务与中间件实践经验的候选人，能够独立完成需求分析、接口设计与联调。"
}

### 10. 岗位匹配历史
GET http://localhost:8080/api/job-matches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 岗位匹配详情（改成真实 id）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/job-matches/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. 删除岗位匹配记录
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/job-matches/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. 创建模拟面试
POST http://localhost:8080/api/interviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resumeId": 3,
  "position": "Java开发工程师"
}

### 14. 开始面试（AI 出第一题）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/interviews/1/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. 回答并追问（可多次）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/interviews/1/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": "Spring Boot 通过自动配置减少了大量 XML 配置，启动时根据类路径条件装配 Bean。"
}

### 16. 结束面试并生成报告
POST http://localhost:8080/api/interviews/1/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. 面试历史
GET http://localhost:8080/api/interviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. 面试详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/interviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. 面试对话
GET http://localhost:8080/api/interviews/1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. 面试报告
GET http://localhost:8080/api/interviews/1/report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. 删除面试
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/interviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== RAG 知识库 5.2 ==========

### 22. 上传知识库 PDF（路径换成你的 PDF；上传后自动解析 → PARSED/FAILED）
# @name knowledgeUpload
POST http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=KnowledgeBoundary

--KnowledgeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="java-interview.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\Users\qqjer\Desktop\简历\简历 (1).pdf
--KnowledgeBoundary--

> {%
    client.global.set("knowledgeDocId", response.body.id);
%}

### 23. 知识库文档列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 24. 知识库文档详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/documents/{{knowledgeDocId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 25. 重新解析（FAILED 时可重试）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/documents/{{knowledgeDocId}}/parse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 26. 删除知识库文档
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/documents/{{knowledgeDocId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
